CONCLUSION: Llama.cpp prompt processing overhead on the larger 8B model creates a ~120ms floor for TTFT, losing to network-bound Groq API (68ms). Switching to Qwen2.5-3B dropped local TTFT to ~28.5ms, making the local fallback definitively faster than cloud.
